cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "@three-ws/blender-mcp"
abstract: "Drive the Blender on your machine from any AI agent, headless. Inspect a 3D file, convert between GLB/glTF/FBX/OBJ/STL/PLY/DAE/USD/Alembic/.blend, render a preview that comes back inline so the assistant can see it, run a bpy script against a scene, and generate a model from a text prompt on the free three.ws Forge lane. Meshopt- and Draco-compressed glTF is decoded automatically. No GUI, no add-on to install, no key."
version: 0.5.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/nirholas/blender-mcp"
url: "https://three.ws"
authors:
